            <ArticleTitle>Prinzmetal variant angina associated with multiple sclerosis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>71-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report the case of a young woman with an acute coronary syndrome in the setting of a multiple sclerosis exacerbation. A connection between the 2, possibly caused by spinal cord pathology, is suggested.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
